[ti:That Is What Light Does]
[ar:Giuntru]
[re:Automatic line alignment - listening review pending]
[00:19.06]I used to think light
[00:21.88]Was a gentle thing
[00:24.16]A clean little mercy
[00:25.74]Entering
[00:26.66]But light has rules
[00:28.08]Light has teeth
[00:29.20]It touches the surface
[00:30.46]Then cuts underneath
[00:31.58]The room looked perfect
[00:33.06]Almost kind
[00:34.22]White on the table
[00:35.50]White in the mind
[00:36.60]Just everything shining
[00:37.84]A little too much
[00:39.34]Light opens
[00:42.26]Shape remains
[00:44.72]The eye is awake
[00:47.36]Nothing is safe
[00:49.88]That is what light does
[00:51.58]It does not forgive
[00:53.60]It shows the shape
[00:56.04]Of what still lives
[00:58.26]That is what light does
[01:01.36]It cuts
[01:02.82]It names
[01:03.98]It makes the hidden
[01:05.18]Stand inside the flame
[01:20.54]The truth came dressed
[01:21.40]In perfect white
[01:22.44]With clean little hands
[01:23.72]And a terrible light
[01:24.74]It said good morning
[01:25.74]It said be still
[01:26.80]It polished the wound
[01:27.92]Until it looked real
[01:28.98]Stand in the light
[01:30.70]Stay very still
[01:32.92]Everything shines
[01:35.42]When it wants to kill
[01:37.94]I froze
[01:38.88]Then I saw
[01:39.98]The room knew more
[01:41.22]Than I knew before
[01:42.24]No mercy in the brightness
[01:43.58]No darkness to blame
[01:44.86]Only the body
[01:45.90]Remembering its name
[01:47.00]
[02:17.48]The altar was only
[02:18.88]A table in white
[02:19.96]The miracle only
[02:21.38]A wound with more light
[02:22.58]Not evil
[02:23.22]Not pure
[02:23.76]Not wrong
[02:24.40]Not right
[02:25.00]Just a little blade
[02:25.92]Made out of light
[02:26.66]The room kept shining
[02:28.20]Too clean
[02:29.36]Too near
[02:30.54]And what I called terror
[02:32.98]Was only seeing clear
[02:35.28]That is what light does
[02:37.48]It does not forgive
[02:39.56]It shows the shape
[02:41.96]Of what still lives
[02:45.02]
[02:47.46]Not darkness
[02:49.40]Not mercy
[02:51.96]Only light
[02:55.44]
